`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["At ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://pimlico.io",children:"Pimlico"})," we have seen a lot of developers using our infrastructure struggle with having to string many SDKs together. Instead of getting them to learn a whole new framework or building a ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"@pimlico/sdk"}),"-like library that would lock the developer to our infrastructure, we decided to build a tool that would allow developers to build on top of APIs they're already familiar with any provider they wish, mixing-and-matching all of the different parts of the stack including bundlers, paymasters, smart account providers, and signers."]}),`
